<p>I'm a little iffy on this one, leaning more towards an upvote.</p>
<p>I like the concept and when I saw &quot;IX Hispana&quot; I couldn't help but fanboy a bit. With that said, I couldn't help but feel as if <em>something</em> was lacking from this article. The tone seems fine, and the concept's pretty cool (the missing 9th Legion showing up in random places), but I just don't know whether or not I like it. No vote for now, but perhaps I'll warm up to it after a third reading.</p>
<p>PS: I'm pretty sure it's spelled &quot;Aesculapius,&quot; but I have seen the spelling you've used somewhere, I suppose.</p>

